1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
MoveBooks AI helps accountants move their books and keep their confidence.
A bounded synthetic Beta by Movers & Ledgers.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Play starts in a bookkeeping office. Explore records, collect evidence
and solve a migration puzzle without changing financial state.

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Try Your Data checks supported permitted test records in the browser.
Hosted uploads remain separately security-gated.

4
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Explore Demo follows Understand, Prepare, Move, Verify and Start.
Readiness findings and a versioned plan make decisions visible.

5
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Account 1200 needs an informed choice. Request explanation and review.
Evidence and uncertainty guide the accountant. Advice cannot approve.

6
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:15,000
An authorized person approves the current plan and mappings.
Deterministic tools execute only the approved synthetic intent.

7
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Checkpoints and idempotency protect recovery.
Policy controls transient retries and human escalation.

8
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Deterministic reconciliation verifies records and balances.
Discrepancies block progression. Sensitive settings need approval.

9
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:15,000
The owner approves a synthetic invoice after required controls pass.
A verified receipt establishes First Productive Use.

10
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Cloud SQL retains financial authority. Google Cloud hosts the boundaries.
Availability claims follow verified runtime evidence.
